{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>ישובו</b> — Yefet said: יושבי בצל הלבנון. In my opinion: יושבי בצל ישראל, and they are the servants, who shall be their farmers and vintners." "<b>יחיו דגן</b> — And the stalks shall blossom like the vine." "<b>וזכרו</b> — Its fragrance is like the manner of its remembrance offering. And Yefet said: the memory of their vine from afar, like the wine of Lebanon."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {0 "Resolved העבדים as 'the servants' based on the context of foreign laborers serving Israel; the reference is to Gentile nations."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:15.452153016Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}